  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - On 7 March 2025 the use of the site as two self-contained flats at 9 Crowther Avenue, comprising a ground floor two-bedroom flat and first and second floor two-bedroom flat (Class C3) was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990.  \r\n\r\nThe applicant has submitted sufficient evidence to demonstrate that, on the balance of probabilities, the building had been in continuous use as two self-contained dwellings (Class C3) since at least 7 March 2021 (four years prior to the validation date of this Certificate of Lawfulness Application) and that continued use to this effect would be lawful.  "
  ],
